{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/apoorv-agarwal-21090b388/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Apoorv Agarwal","author_headline":"Building Patient Acquisition Systems for Aesthetic Clinics | Founder @AVmedia (Dubai)","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/apoorv-agarwal-21090b388/","post_text":"You may be losing patients at the exact moment they decide to book.","text":"Good audit. I'd run a second version at 11 PM: send an enquiry and time how long until a human replies. I once called 5 clinics at 11 PM with a toothache. 3 didn't answer, 1 played a voicemail reading out opening hours, 1 was Arabic-only. The 6th picked up and got the patient. Does your audit cover the after-hours path?","stage":"connected","note":"Channel lane: agency selling to aesthetic clinics. Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct (no note). Mutual: Maya Khoury. After accept: DM a question about their clients' after-hours enquiries.","id":"9bdbd551f19f","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/social-media-marketingspecialist/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Muhammad Bilal","author_headline":"Digital Marketing Specialist | Meta Ads & Lead Generation | Dubai Real Estate Marketing","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/social-media-marketingspecialist/","post_text":"A cheap cost per lead is not a result. An answered lead is.","text":"The 186 conversations answered within minutes is the number that matters here. Do you track time to first reply per campaign next to CPL? A lead answered in 5 minutes and one called back tomorrow are different leads at the same cost, and most reports only show the cost.","stage":"connected","note":"Channel lane: runs Meta Ads for Dubai brokerages (many clients). Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct. Strong fit for a partner conversation.","id":"ddd3bcf078ac","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/anton-neugebauer-959748115/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Anton Neugebauer","author_headline":"Helping Private Practices Scale Profitable Campaigns & Automations (Real ADvice Practice Consulting)","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/anton-neugebauer-959748115/","post_text":"Your 'strategy' is 'we need more patients.' That's not a strategy. That's a wish.","text":"Good split. Under tactics I'd add one metric for the front desk: time from enquiry to first human reply, split by business hours and after 7 PM. A strategy can name the avatar perfectly and still lose them in the gap between interest and the first reply. Which number do you have owners track weekly?","stage":"connected","note":"Channel lane: consultant for private practices (US, Miami). Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct.","id":"847db2ad9df8","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/pankajkumar76301/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Pankaj Kumar","author_headline":"Founder @ CoBroker | Simple CRM for real estate brokers | Helping Dubai brokers close more deals","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/pankajkumar76301/","post_text":"After watching brokers juggle WhatsApp chats, Excel sheets and sticky notes, I built CoBroker.","text":"The sticky notes stage is real. One thing I'd check in any broker CRM: does a new WhatsApp enquiry create the lead by itself, or does it wait for someone to type it in? The first minutes after an enquiry decide a lot, and manual entry eats them. How does CoBroker capture enquiries today?","stage":"connected","note":"Peer / possible integration partner (broker CRM, ~30 followers). Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct.","id":"cb20bb73ff46","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/atharammar/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Athar Ammar","author_headline":"Helping Health and Real Estate Businesses | Full Stack Development | Marketing Agency | Web Development","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/atharammar/","post_text":"Most real estate brokerages don't have a lead generation problem. They have an intake leakage problem.","text":"Intake leakage is a better name than lead generation problem. The step that gets missed is ownership: the alert reaches a broker who is mid-showing, so the first 4 minutes belong to nobody. Do your clients assign that owner by rota, or is it still whoever sees it first?","stage":"connected","note":"Channel lane: agency for health + real estate (4.9k followers). Post is RubyOrbit-flavoured. Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct.","id":"1316217ef28a","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/faiyazuddinahmed/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Muhammad Faiyaz Uddin Ahmed","author_headline":"Helping US Dentists Fill More Chairs Through Google | Local SEO | Founder, LocalVisi Digital","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/faiyazuddinahmed/","post_text":"Referrals are valuable. But they aren't the only way patients can find you. (521 calls from Google Business Profile in a month)","text":"521 calls in a month is a strong number. The follow-up question for the practice is what happens to those calls at 7 PM or when the front desk is on another line. I once called 5 clinics at 11 PM with a toothache and only the 6th picked up. Did the case study track how many of the 521 were actually answered?","stage":"connected","note":"Channel lane: local SEO agency for US dentists (Doha-based). Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct. Natural angle: calls he generates that nobody answers.","id":"2571bbafbb07","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/elena-herre-4117208/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Elena Herre","author_headline":"Founder, PrimeVision Automation Studio | PV HUB (Dubai real estate follow-up automation)","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/elena-herre-4117208/","post_text":"Lead Leak #2 of 5: the second message nobody sends (day 2 and day 5 follow-ups).","text":"The day 2 and day 5 cadence makes sense. The stop-when-they-reply rule is the part that protects trust: nothing hurts more than an automated nudge landing after the client already answered. I built that same tripwire into my own outbound system, checking the inbox for a reply before every send. Do you check for replies across every channel or just WhatsApp?","stage":"connected","note":"Same-space builder (competitor-adjacent), reaches Dubai agencies. Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct. Treat as peer, not a buyer.","id":"52b37def6c5c","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/albin-mj/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Albin M Jose","author_headline":"Data Scientist | AI Automation Engineer | Python, SQL, n8n, Power BI (Dubai)","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/albin-mj/","post_text":"I built an AI assistant for a made-up real estate company in Dubai.","text":"The 51% first run that turned out to be the test setup is the honest part. Writing the 35 cases yourself is the classic trap, so do you plan a second set built from real WhatsApp messages? In a voice agent I built, the failures only showed up with accents and names, never in the clean test calls.","stage":"connected","note":"Builder peer (audience B: AI/ML network). Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct.","id":"917b282b9de3","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shivamluthra/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Shivam Luthra","author_headline":"Founder & CEO at Reva AI | AI-Native Conversational Intelligence for Real Estate Agents","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shivamluthra/","post_text":"What a Real Estate agent should actually be invested on vs what they spend their time on.","text":"The 'Available?' enquiries are the hard part: most aren't worth an agent's hour, but a few are the serious buyer. In the flows I build, the agent only gets pulled in once budget, area and timeline are captured and the lead is ready to talk. Where do you draw the line between what the assistant answers and what goes to the agent?","stage":"connected","note":"Already a 1st-degree connection (no request needed). Same-space founder (peer). Commented 12 Oct.","id":"05aa80097ec1","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/punya-mehra-8259a22ba/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Punya Mehra","author_headline":"Founder | Aurah Real Estate | Dubai","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/punya-mehra-8259a22ba/","post_text":"The Biggest Mistake I See Investors Make in Dubai Real Estate.","text":"\"What's the best deal right now?\" usually means the investor hasn't been asked their goal yet. The first reply sets the tone: a list of units, or a question about rental income versus appreciation. Lists are faster to send, so I'd guess most agencies default to them. How do you handle that first WhatsApp message: goal question first, or listings first?","stage":"connected","note":"BUYER lane: Dubai brokerage founder. Commented + connection request sent 12 Oct. Highest priority to DM once accepted (question about first-reply handling).","id":"2d5bd0f5efe6","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
{"kind":"manual","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hassan-ahmed-1819a3433/recent-activity/all/","author_name":"Hassan Ahmed","author_headline":"Founder & Managing Director at Dar Al Safwah Real Estate (Sharjah/UAE)","author_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hassan-ahmed-1819a3433/","post_text":"","text":"","stage":"connected","note":"BUYER lane: brokerage MD. Connection request only (no recent original post to comment on), sent 12 Oct. Comment on his next post.","id":"8fddefe30e0a","ts":"2026-10-12T08:28:03.832Z"}
